        'tenants': 'fa-building-user', 'plans': 'fa-tags', 'subscriptions': 'fa-arrows-rotate', 'invoices': 'fa-file-invoice', 'payments': 'fa-indian-rupee-sign', 'gateways': 'fa-credit-card', 'demo-requests': 'fa-key'
    };
    function decorateSubmenuIcons() {
        if (!document.getElementById('sp-subic-css')) {
            var st = document.createElement('style');
            st.id = 'sp-subic-css';
            st.textContent = '.sidebar .nav-sub{margin-left:19px;border-left:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,.10)}'
                + '.sidebar .nav-sub .nav-item{padding-left:20px;position:relative}'
                + '.sidebar .nav-sub .nav-item::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:50%;width:9px;height:1.5px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.13)}'
                + '.sidebar .nav-sub .nav-item i.sp-subic{width:16px;text-align:center;font-size:12.5px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.55);flex-shrink:0}'
                + '.sidebar .nav-sub .nav-item:hover i.sp-subic{color:#fff}'
                + '.sidebar .nav-sub .nav-item.active i.sp-subic{color:var(--accent)}';
            document.head.appendChild(st);
        }
        document.querySelectorAll('.sidebar .nav-sub .nav-item[data-id]').forEach(function (el) {
            if (el.querySelector('i')) { return; }
            var id = el.getAttribute('data-id');
            var ic = SUB_ICONS[id] || 'fa-angle-right';
            var i = document.createElement('i');
            i.className = 'fas ' + ic + ' sp-subic';
            el.insertBefore(i, el.firstChild);
        });
    }
    // rev 91: REAL Ametecs logo in the sidebar (Ejaz's file, public/images/logo.png).
    // Done in boot JS (not app.html) — the prototype file is replaced wholesale on
    // deploys and this keeps the swap in one reviewable place. The old bolt+text
    // brand is hidden, not removed, so per-company applyBranding still works.
    function wireSidebarLogo() {
        var host = document.querySelector('.sidebar .brand');
        if (!host || host.__realLogo) { return; }
        var icon = host.querySelector('.brand-icon');
        if (icon) { icon.style.display = 'none'; }
        var txt = host.querySelector('.brand-text');
        if (txt) { txt.style.display = 'none'; }
        var img = document.createElement('img');
        img.src = (cfg && cfg.appLogo) ? cfg.appLogo : '/images/logo.png';   // rev184 — per-client logo when set
        img.alt = 'SmartPRS - Reputation | Relationships | Results';
        img.style.cssText = 'height:38px;width:auto;display:block;max-width:200px;object-fit:contain';
        host.appendChild(img);
        host.__realLogo = true;
    }
    // rev 81 (team test #5): the sidebar user-card is STATIC prototype text
    // ("Ejaz Hussain · Managing Director") — show the real logged-in person.
    function wireUserCard(cfg) {
        var card = document.querySelector('.user-card');
        if (!card || card.__wired) { return; }
        var name = cfg.user || '';
        if (!name) { return; }
        var h = card.querySelector('.user-info h4');
        var s = card.querySelector('.user-info span');
        var av = card.querySelector('.user-avatar');
        if (h) { h.textContent = name; }
        if (s) { s.textContent = (cfg.role || '') + (cfg.company ? ' · ' + cfg.company : ''); }
        if (av) {
            var parts = name.trim().split(/[^A-Za-z]+/).filter(function (x) { return x.length; });
            var ini = (parts[0] ? parts[0][0] : '') + (parts[1] ? parts[1][0] : '');
            var initials = (ini || name.slice(0, 2)).toUpperCase();
            av.textContent = initials;
            // rev 130 (Ejaz): show the logged-in user's PROFILE PHOTO in the
            // sidebar card when they have one; keep the initials as the fallback
            // (a user with no photo simply keeps the coloured initials avatar).
            if (cfg.myPhotoUrl) {
                var probe = new Image();
                probe.onload = function () {
                    av.textContent = '';
                    av.style.overflow = 'hidden';
                    var img = document.createElement('img');
                    img.src = probe.src;
                    img.alt = name;
                    img.style.cssText = 'width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;border-radius:inherit;display:block';
                    av.appendChild(img);
                };
                probe.onerror = function () {};
                probe.src = cfg.myPhotoUrl + '?t=' + Date.now();
            }
        }
        card.__wired = true;
    }
    // rev 79c (Ejaz): Live Salary belongs in MAIN, right under Dashboard —
    // moved out of Payroll (his explicit choice: "remove from payroll, your wish").
    function injectLiveSalaryNav(cfg) {
        // rev 88 (Ejaz live check): the platform owner is not an employee — the
        // Super Admin login gets NO Live Salary item (it was listing tenant /
        // demo employees in the SaaS panel). Punch In stays (his choice).
        // rev184 (Ejaz): the plain Employee login gets NO Live Salary either.
        if (cfg && (cfg.role === 'Super Admin' || cfg.role === 'Employee')) {
            document.querySelectorAll('.nav-item[data-id="live-salary"]').forEach(function (nv) { nv.style.display = 'none'; });
            return;
        }
        var dash = document.querySelector('.nav-item[data-id="dashboard"]');
        if (!dash || !dash.parentNode || dash.parentNode.__lsNav) { return; }
        document.querySelectorAll('.nav-item[data-id="live-salary"]').forEach(function (nv) { nv.style.display = 'none'; });
        var d = document.createElement('div');
        d.className = 'nav-item';
        d.setAttribute('data-id', 'live-salary');
        d.setAttribute('onclick', "go('live-salary',this)");
        d.textContent = 'Live Salary';
        dash.parentNode.insertBefore(d, dash.nextSibling);
        dash.parentNode.__lsNav = true;
    }
    // rev 88 (Ejaz): the rev-87 money ledger (All / Salary / Commissions) gets
    // its OWN nav item under Payroll — it was reachable only via a button
    // inside Commission Entries and he could not find it. Placed after Payslips.
    function injectPayLedgerNav() {
        var anchor = document.querySelector('.nav-item[data-id="payslip"]')
            || document.querySelector('.nav-item[data-id="salary-gen"]')
            || document.querySelector('.nav-item[data-id="commissions"]');
        if (!anchor || !anchor.parentNode || anchor.parentNode.__payLedgerNav) { return; }
        var d = document.createElement('div');
        d.className = 'nav-item';
        d.setAttribute('data-id', 'pay-ledger');
        d.setAttribute('onclick', "go('pay-ledger',this)");
        d.textContent = 'Salary & Commission Ledger';
        anchor.parentNode.insertBefore(d, anchor.nextSibling);
        anchor.parentNode.__payLedgerNav = true;
    }
    // Subscription banner + lock-out UI (rev 75). States from the server:
    //   grace  → bottom warning bar (admin only), app fully usable
    //   locked → every navigation is forced to My Subscription (middleware
    //            already blocks data endpoints; employees never get here)
    //   active with <=15 days left → soft reminder bar (admin only)
    function wireSubBanner(cfg) {
        if (cfg.subState === 'locked') {
            var bar = document.createElement('div');
            bar.style.cssText = 'position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:8500;background:#b91c1c;color:#fff;padding:10px 16px;text-align:center;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600';
            bar.innerHTML = 'Your subscription has expired and the workspace is suspended for your team. Renew below to restore access immediately.';
            document.body.appendChild(bar);
            try {
                var prevGo = window.go;
                window.go = function () { return prevGo('my-subscription', document.querySelector('.nav-item[data-id="my-subscription"]')); };
                window.go.__memWrapped = true;
            } catch (e) {}
            try { window.go(); } catch (e) {}
            return;
        }
        if (cfg.role !== 'Admin') { return; }
        var soft = cfg.subState === 'active' && cfg.subDays !== null && cfg.subDays !== undefined && cfg.subDays <= 15;
        if (cfg.subState !== 'grace' && ! soft) { return; }
        var grace = cfg.subState === 'grace';
        var warn = document.createElement('div');
        warn.style.cssText = 'position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:8500;background:' + (grace ? '#b45309' : '#0f1d33') + ';color:#fff;padding:9px 16px;text-align:center;font-size:13px';
        warn.innerHTML = (grace
            ? '<b>Your subscription expired on ' + (cfg.subEnd || '') + '.</b> The workspace suspends after the grace period - '
            : '<b>Your subscription expires in ' + cfg.subDays + ' day' + (cfg.subDays === 1 ? '' : 's') + ' (on ' + (cfg.subEnd || '') + ').</b> ')
            + '<a onclick="go(&#39;my-subscription&#39;)" style="color:#fff;text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer;font-weight:700">Renew now</a>'
            + '<i class="fas fa-xmark" onclick="this.parentNode.remove()" style="margin-left:14px;cursor:pointer"></i>';
        document.body.appendChild(warn);
    }
    // POST an employee (add or edit) to the real employees table (server upserts by emp_code).
    function postEmp(emp) {
        return fetch(cfg.empStoreUrl, {
            method: 'POST', credentials: 'same-origin',
            headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json', 'X-CSRF-TOKEN': cfg.csrf, 'X-Requested-With': 'XMLHttpRequest' },
            body: JSON.stringify({ employee: emp })
        }).then(function (r) { return r.json(); });
    }
    // Read every f_* form field into an object, merged onto a base employee.
    function readEmpForm(base) {
        var o = Object.assign({}, base || {});
        document.querySelectorAll('[id^="f_"]').forEach(function (el) { o[el.id.slice(2)] = el.value; });
        o.ctc = Number(o.ctc) || 0;
        return o;
    }
    // Open the Add Employee form pre-filled for an existing employee (full edit).
    window.editEmployee = function (id) {
        // rev 81 (team test #7): ids arrive as number OR string depending on the
        // caller (onboarding card vs directory) — compare loosely, and tell the
        // user instead of failing silently.
        var emp = ((typeof DB !== 'undefined' && DB.employees) || []).find(function (e) { return String(e.id) === String(id); });
        if (!emp) { if (typeof toast === 'function') { toast('Employee record not found — refresh the page (Ctrl+F5) and try again.'); } return; }
        window._editEmp = emp;
        go('emp-add', document.querySelector('.nav-item[data-id="emp-add"]'));
        setTimeout(function () { prefillEmp(emp); }, 40);
    };
    function prefillEmp(emp) {
        Object.keys(emp).forEach(function (k) {
            if (k === 'refs' || emp[k] === null || typeof emp[k] === 'object') { return; }
            var el = document.getElementById('f_' + k);
            if (el) { el.value = emp[k]; }
        });
        var refs = emp.refs || [];
        while (document.querySelectorAll('[id^="refrow_"]').length < refs.length && typeof addRefRow === 'function') { addRefRow(); }
        var rows = document.querySelectorAll('[id^="refrow_"]');
        refs.forEach(function (r, i) {
            var row = rows[i]; if (!row) { return; }
            var n = row.id.replace('refrow_', '');
            var set = function (f, v) { var el = document.getElementById('ref_' + n + '_' + f); if (el) { el.value = v || ''; } };
            set('name', r.name); set('relation', r.relation); set('aadhaar', r.aadhaar); set('pan', r.pan);
            set('mobile', r.mobile); set('email', r.email); set('whatsapp', r.whatsapp);
            window._refV = window._refV || {}; window._refV[n] = r.verify || {};
        });
        var h = document.querySelector('.content .page-header h2, #host h2');
        if (h) { h.textContent = 'Edit Employee — ' + (emp.name || ''); }
        // rev173b — "Audit Report" (RBI compliance PDF) also from the Directory
        // edit screen (admin/HR), same link as the profile popup.
        try {
            var oldAud = document.getElementById('sp-audit-link'); if (oldAud) { oldAud.remove(); }
            var canAud = cfg.role === 'Admin' || cfg.role === 'Super Admin' || String(cfg.role || '').indexOf('HR') >= 0;
            var safeAud = String(emp.id || '').replace(/[^A-Za-z0-9_-]/g, '');
            if (h && canAud && safeAud) {
                var aud = document.createElement('a');
                aud.id = 'sp-audit-link';
                aud.className = 'btn btn-outline btn-sm';
                aud.href = '/app/compliance/agent-audit/' + safeAud + '/pdf';
                aud.target = '_blank'; aud.rel = 'noopener';
                aud.title = 'RBI compliance audit report (PDF)';
                aud.style.marginLeft = '12px'; aud.style.verticalAlign = 'middle';
                aud.innerHTML = '<i class="fas fa-shield-halved"></i> Audit Report';
                h.appendChild(aud);
            }
        } catch (eAud) {}
    }
    // Intercept the prototype's save -> persist to the real employees table (add or edit).
    function wireEmployeeSave(cfg) {
        if (typeof saveEmp !== 'function' || saveEmp.__wired) { return; }
        var original = saveEmp;
        window.saveEmp = function () {
            var refs = collectRefs();
            // F5 — DRA & PCC self-declaration (Yes/No) are MANDATORY when onboarding
            // a NEW hire. Not enforced on edit so pre-existing records aren't blocked.
            if (!window._editEmp) {
                var _draEl = document.getElementById('f_draDeclared');
                var _pccEl = document.getElementById('f_pccDeclared');
                if ((_draEl && !_draEl.value) || (_pccEl && !_pccEl.value)) {
                    if (typeof toast === 'function') { toast('Please answer DRA Status and PCC Status (Yes/No) in the Documents tab — both are required.'); }
                    var _tb = document.querySelector('.tab[onclick*="tab-ed"]');
                    if (_tb && typeof showTab === 'function') { showTab('tab-ed', _tb); }
                    return;
                }
            }
            if (window._editEmp) {
                var editing = window._editEmp;
                var updated = readEmpForm(editing); updated.orig_id = editing.id; updated.refs = refs;
                var idx = (DB.employees || []).findIndex(function (e) { return e.id === editing.id; });
                if (idx >= 0) { DB.employees[idx] = updated; }
                if (typeof persist === 'function') { persist(); }
                postEmp(updated).then(function () { if (typeof toast === 'function') { toast('Employee updated'); } }).catch(function () {});
                window._editEmp = null;
                go('emp-list', document.querySelector('.nav-item[data-id="emp-list"]'));
                return;
            }
            var before = (DB.employees || []).length;
            original.apply(this, arguments);
            if ((DB.employees || []).length > before) {
                var emp = Object.assign({}, DB.employees[0], { refs: refs });
                // The prototype's native saveEmp() doesn't copy team/manager/leader
                // into the record — read them straight off the form so they persist.
                ['team', 'teamManager', 'teamLeader', 'designation', 'branch', 'dept', 'shift', 'draDeclared', 'pccDeclared'].forEach(function (k) {
                    var el = document.getElementById('f_' + k); if (el && el.value) { emp[k] = el.value; }
                });
                var _fid = document.getElementById('f_id'); if (_fid && _fid.value && _fid.value.trim()) { emp.id = _fid.value.trim(); }
                postEmp(emp).then(function (d) { if (d && d.ok && typeof toast === 'function') { toast('Saved to database (' + d.emp_code + ')'); } }).catch(function () {});
            }
        };
        window.saveEmp.__wired = true;
    }
    function collectRefs() {
        var refs = [];
        document.querySelectorAll('[id^="refrow_"]').forEach(function (row) {
            var n = row.id.replace('refrow_', '');
            var g = function (f) { var el = document.getElementById('ref_' + n + '_' + f); return el ? el.value : ''; };
            if (g('name') && g('name').trim()) {
                refs.push({
                    name: g('name'), relation: g('relation'), aadhaar: g('aadhaar'), pan: g('pan'),
                    mobile: g('mobile'), email: g('email'), whatsapp: g('whatsapp'),
                    verify: (window._refV && window._refV[n]) || {}
                });
            }
        });
        return refs;
    }
    // Save the whole app state to the database (debounced) on every change.
    var _stateTimer = null;
    // Persist everything EXCEPT employees (authoritative in the DB table). This
    // stops prototype/sample employees from being written back into app-state.
    function stateForSave() {
        if (typeof DB === 'undefined') { return {}; }
        var copy = {}; for (var k in DB) { if (k !== 'employees') { copy[k] = DB[k]; } }
        return copy;
    }
    function syncState(cfg) {
        try {
            fetch(cfg.stateSaveUrl, {
                method: 'POST', credentials: 'same-origin',
                headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json', 'X-CSRF-TOKEN': cfg.csrf, 'X-Requested-With': 'XMLHttpRequest' },
                body: JSON.stringify({ state: stateForSave() })
            });
        } catch (e) {}
    }
    function wireStatePersist(cfg) {
        if (typeof persist !== 'function' || persist.__stateWrapped) { return; }
        var _persist = persist;
        window.persist = function () {
            try { _persist.apply(this, arguments); } catch (e) {}
            clearTimeout(_stateTimer);
            _stateTimer = setTimeout(function () { syncState(cfg); }, 700);
        };
        window.persist.__stateWrapped = true;
    }
    // Universal row edit: employees use the full form; all other list screens
    // reuse the prototype's add modal, pre-filled, saving back to the same record.
    window.rowEdit = function (sid, id) {
        if (sid === 'emp-list') { window.editEmployee(id); return; }
        openEdit(sid, id);
    };
    window.openEdit = function (sid, id) {
        if (typeof SCREENS === 'undefined' || typeof openAdd !== 'function') { return; }
        var s = SCREENS[sid]; if (!s) { return; }
        var coll = s.type === 'lettered' ? 'letters' : s.coll;
        var rec = ((DB[coll]) || []).find(function (r) { return r.id === id; });
        if (!rec) { return; }
        openAdd(sid);
        (window._addFields || []).forEach(function (f) {
            var el = document.getElementById('f_' + f.k);
            if (el && rec[f.k] != null) { el.value = rec[f.k]; }
        });
        window._editId = id;
        var mh = document.querySelector('#modal .mh h3'); if (mh) { mh.textContent = 'Edit — ' + s.title; }
    };
    function wireGenericEdit() {
        if (typeof saveAdd !== 'function' || saveAdd.__wrapped) { return; }
        var _saveAdd = saveAdd;
        window.saveAdd = function (sid) {
            if (window._editId) {
                var s = SCREENS[sid]; var coll = s.type === 'lettered' ? 'letters' : s.coll;
                var id = window._editId; var rec = ((DB[coll]) || []).find(function (r) { return r.id === id; });
                if (rec) {
                    (window._addFields || []).forEach(function (f) {
                        var el = document.getElementById('f_' + f.k); if (el) { rec[f.k] = el.value; }
                    });
                    if (typeof persist === 'function') { persist(); }
                    if (typeof render === 'function') { render(); }
                    if (typeof closeModal === 'function') { closeModal(); }
                    if (typeof toast === 'function') { toast('Updated'); }
                }
                window._editId = null;
                return;
            }
            _saveAdd(sid);
        };
        window.saveAdd.__wrapped = true;
    }
    // ------------------------------------------------------------------
    // ENHANCEMENT ROADMAP (26 Jul 2026) — front-end for the nine features
    // built server-side in this release: notifications inbox (P0), attendance
    // correction (F2), employee today panel (F3), probation board + settings
    // (F6/F7), greetings (F8), employee import wizard (F9) and previous-day
    // absence settings (F10).
    //
    // Additive by design: it registers new SCREENS ids, chains onto
    // renderCustom the same way wireCustomScreens() does, and injects its nav
    // items at run time (the injectMySubNav pattern) so app.html is untouched
    // and no existing screen is moved or hidden.
    //
    // NOTE: this block lives inside a PHP heredoc — it must never contain a
    // dollar sign or a backslash.
    // ------------------------------------------------------------------
    function wireRoadmapScreens(cfg) {
        if (typeof SCREENS === 'undefined') { return; }

        // Consistent professional styling for every new-feature screen, scoped
        // to .rm-screen so nothing else in the app is touched.
        if (!document.getElementById('rm-screen-css')) {
            var rmCss = document.createElement('style');
            rmCss.id = 'rm-screen-css';
            rmCss.textContent = '.rm-screen .card{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(16,24,40,.05)}'
                + '.rm-screen .form-input,.rm-screen input[type=text],.rm-screen input[type=number],.rm-screen input[type=date],.rm-screen input[type=time],.rm-screen input[type=email],.rm-screen select,.rm-screen textarea{border-radius:9px;border:1px solid var(--border);padding:9px 11px;font-size:13.5px;background:#fff;transition:border-color .15s ease,box-shadow .15s ease}'
                + '.rm-screen .form-input:focus,.rm-screen input:focus,.rm-screen select:focus,.rm-screen textarea:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--primary,#f97316);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(249,115,22,.15)}'
                + '.rm-screen input[type=checkbox]{accent-color:var(--primary,#f97316);width:15px;height:15px;vertical-align:-2px;cursor:pointer}'
                + '.rm-screen .btn{border-radius:9px}'
                + '.rm-screen table th{background:var(--bg2,#f8fafc)}'
                + '.rm-screen table tbody tr:hover{background:var(--bg2,#fafbfc)}';
            document.head.appendChild(rmCss);
        }

        var TITLES = {
            'notifications': 'Notifications',
            'att-correction': 'Attendance Correction',
            'probation': 'Probation Tracking',
            'probation-config': 'Probation Settings',
            'greetings': 'Greetings',
            'greetings-log': 'Greetings Log',
            'emp-import': 'Import Employees',
            'absence-config': 'Absence Alerts',
            'statutory-config': 'Statutory Configuration'
        };
        for (var sk in TITLES) {
            try { SCREENS[sk] = { title: TITLES[sk], type: 'custom' }; } catch (e) {}
        }
        // Menu icons for the new items (the icon pass re-runs for late nav).
        try {
            if (typeof SUB_ICONS !== 'undefined') {
                SUB_ICONS['att-correction'] = 'fa-pen-to-square';
                SUB_ICONS['probation'] = 'fa-hourglass-half';
                SUB_ICONS['probation-config'] = 'fa-hourglass-start';
                SUB_ICONS['greetings'] = 'fa-cake-candles';
                SUB_ICONS['greetings-log'] = 'fa-envelope-open-text';
                SUB_ICONS['emp-import'] = 'fa-file-import';
                SUB_ICONS['absence-config'] = 'fa-user-clock';
                SUB_ICONS['statutory-config'] = 'fa-scale-balanced';
            }
        } catch (e) {}

        // ---- tiny shared helpers ---------------------------------------
        function esc(v) {
            var s = (v === null || v === undefined) ? '' : String(v);
            s = s.split('&').join('&amp;');
            s = s.split('<').join('&lt;');
            s = s.split('>').join('&gt;');
            s = s.split('"').join('&quot;');
            return s;
        }
        function say(m) { if (typeof toast === 'function') { toast(m); } }
        function repaint() { if (typeof render === 'function') { render(); } }
        function getJson(url, key) {
            fetch(url, { headers: { 'X-Requested-With': 'XMLHttpRequest' }, credentials: 'same-origin' })
                .then(function (r) { return r.json(); })
                .then(function (j) { window[key] = j || { ok: false }; repaint(); })
                .catch(function () { window[key] = { ok: false, error: 'Network error' }; repaint(); });
        }
        function post(url, body) {
            return fetch(url, {
                method: 'POST',
                headers: {
                    'Content-Type': 'application/json',
                    'X-CSRF-TOKEN': cfg.csrf,
                    'X-Requested-With': 'XMLHttpRequest'
                },
                credentials: 'same-origin',
                body: JSON.stringify(body || {})
            }).then(function (r) { return r.json(); });
        }
        function loading(title) {
            return pghead(title, 'Loading…', '')
                + '<div class="card"><div style="padding:36px;text-align:center;color:var(--text3)">Loading…</div></div>';
        }
        function empty(msg) {
            return '<div style="padding:30px;text-align:center;color:var(--text3);font-size:13.5px">' + esc(msg) + '</div>';
        }
        function errCard(title, e) {
            return pghead(title, 'Error', '')
                + '<div class="card"><div style="padding:24px;color:var(--red)">' + esc(e || 'Could not load.') + '</div></div>';
        }
        function pill(text, bg, fg) {
            return '<span style="background:' + bg + ';color:' + fg + ';font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:3px 10px;'
                + 'border-radius:99px;text-transform:uppercase">' + esc(text) + '</span>';
        }
        function statusPill(st) {
            var m = {
                pending: ['#fef3c7', '#92400e'], approved: ['#dbeafe', '#1e40af'],
                applied: ['#dcfce7', '#15803d'], rejected: ['#fee2e2', '#b91c1c'],
                cancelled: ['#e5e7eb', '#4b5563'], imported: ['#dcfce7', '#15803d'],
                staged: ['#fef3c7', '#92400e'], failed: ['#fee2e2', '#b91c1c']
            };
            var c = m[st] || ['#e5e7eb', '#4b5563'];
            return pill(st || '—', c[0], c[1]);
        }
        function fieldRow(label, inputHtml) {
            return '<div style="margin-bottom:14px"><label style="display:block;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;'
                + 'text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;color:var(--text3);margin-bottom:6px">' + esc(label) + '</label>' + inputHtml + '</div>';
        }
        function val(id) { var el = document.getElementById(id); return el ? el.value : ''; }
        function checked(id) { var el = document.getElementById(id); return el ? !!el.checked : false; }
        function tblOpen(cols) {
            var h = '<div style="overflow:auto"><table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px"><thead><tr>';
            for (var i = 0; i < cols.length; i++) {
                h += '<th style="text-align:left;padding:9px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);font-size:11px;'
                    + 'text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.4px;color:var(--text3)">' + esc(cols[i]) + '</th>';
            }
            return h + '</tr></thead><tbody>';
        }
        function td(v, extra) {
            return '<td style="padding:9px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);' + (extra || '') + '">' + v + '</td>';
        }
        var tblClose = '</tbody></table></div>';

        // =================================================================
        // P0 — notifications inbox + bell badge
        // =================================================================
        function notificationsScreen() {
            var d = window.__RM_NOTIF;
            if (!d) { getJson('/app/notifications/feed', '__RM_NOTIF'); return loading('Notifications'); }
            if (!d.ok) { return errCard('Notifications', d.error); }
            var head = pghead('Notifications', (d.unread || 0) + ' unread',
                '<button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="rmNotifReadAll()"><i class="fas fa-check-double"></i> Mark all read</button>');
            if (!d.items || !d.items.length) { return head + '<div class="card">' + empty('Nothing yet. Alerts about approvals, probation, greetings and attendance will appear here.') + '</div>'; }
            var rows = '';
            for (var i = 0; i < d.items.length; i++) {
                var n = d.items[i];
                rows += '<div style="padding:13px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;'
                    + (n.read ? '' : 'background:var(--bg2,#f8fafc)') + '">'
                    + '<div style="flex:1;cursor:pointer" onclick="rmNotifOpen(' + n.id + (n.url ? ",'" + esc(n.url) + "'" : '') + ')">'
                    + '<div style="font-weight:' + (n.read ? '500' : '700') + ';font-size:13.5px">' + esc(n.title) + '</div>'
                    + (n.body ? '<div style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text3);margin-top:3px">' + esc(n.body) + '</div>' : '')
                    + '<div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text3);margin-top:5px">' + esc(n.at) + '</div></div>'
                    + (n.read ? '' : '<div style="width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent,#2563eb);margin-top:6px"></div>')
                    + '</div>';
            }
            return head + '<div class="card" style="padding:0">' + rows + '</div>';
        }
        window.rmNotifOpen = function (id, url) {
            post('/app/notifications/' + id + '/read', {}).then(function () {
                window.__RM_NOTIF = null;
                rmBell();
                if (url) { try { go(url); return; } catch (e) {} }
                repaint();
            });
        };
        window.rmNotifReadAll = function () {
            post('/app/notifications/read-all', {}).then(function () {
                window.__RM_NOTIF = null; rmBell(); repaint(); say('All caught up');
            });
        };
        // Bell badge — polls the same feed and paints a count on the topbar bell.
        function rmBell() {
            fetch('/app/notifications/feed', { headers: { 'X-Requested-With': 'XMLHttpRequest' }, credentials: 'same-origin' })
                .then(function (r) { return r.json(); })
                .then(function (j) {
                    if (!j || !j.ok) { return; }
                    var bells = document.querySelectorAll('.fa-bell');
                    for (var i = 0; i < bells.length; i++) {
                        var host = bells[i].parentNode;
                        if (!host) { continue; }
                        if (host.style.position !== 'relative') { host.style.position = 'relative'; }
                        var dot = host.querySelector('.rm-badge');
                        if (!dot) {
                            dot = document.createElement('span');
                            dot.className = 'rm-badge';
                            host.appendChild(dot);
                            host.style.cursor = 'pointer';
                            host.onclick = function () { try { go('notifications'); } catch (e) {} };
                        }
                        dot.textContent = j.unread ? String(j.unread) : '';
                        dot.style.cssText = 'position:absolute;top:-5px;right:-6px;background:#e11d48;color:#fff;border-radius:99px;'
                            + 'font-size:10px;font-weight:700;line-height:16px;min-width:16px;height:16px;text-align:center;padding:0 4px;'
                            + (j.unread ? '' : 'display:none');
                    }
                })
                .catch(function () {});
        }
        window.rmBell = rmBell;

        // =================================================================
        // F3 — "my attendance today" card, prepended to the dashboard
        // =================================================================
        function todayCard() {
            var d = window.__RM_TODAY;
            if (!d) {
                getJson('/app/today', '__RM_TODAY');
                return '';
            }
            if (!d.ok || !d.linked) { return ''; }
            var body;
            if (d.status === 'no_record') {
                body = '<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px">'
                    + '<i class="fas fa-circle-exclamation" style="font-size:22px;color:#d97706"></i>'
                    + '<div><div style="font-weight:700;font-size:14px">No attendance recorded today</div>'
                    + '<div style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text3)">If you are working, punch in — or raise a correction.</div></div>'
                    + '<div style="margin-left:auto"><button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="go(&#39;att-correction&#39;)">'
                    + '<i class="fas fa-pen-to-square"></i> Raise correction</button></div></div>';
            } else {
                var cell = function (lbl, v) {
                    return '<div><div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text3);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.4px">'
                        + esc(lbl) + '</div><div style="font-weight:800;font-size:19px;padding-top:2px">' + esc(v) + '</div></div>';
                };
                body = '<div style="display:flex;gap:30px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center">'
                    + cell('Check in', d.first_in || '—')
                    + cell('Check out', d.last_out || '—')
                    + cell('Hours', d.working_hours ? String(d.working_hours) : '—')
                    + '<div>' + (d.late === true ? pill('Late by ' + d.late_by_min + 'm', '#fee2e2', '#b91c1c')
                        : (d.late === false ? pill('On time', '#dcfce7', '#15803d') : ''))
                    + '</div>'
                    + '<div style="margin-left:auto"><button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="go(&#39;att-correction&#39;)">'
                    + '<i class="fas fa-pen-to-square"></i> Correction</button></div></div>';
            }
            return '<div class="card" style="padding:16px 20px;margin-bottom:14px">'
                + '<div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text3);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;margin-bottom:9px">My attendance today</div>'
                + body + '</div>';
        }

        // =================================================================
        // F2 — attendance correction
        // =================================================================
        function attCorrectionScreen() {
            var d = window.__RM_ATTC;
            if (!d) { getJson('/app/attendance-corrections', '__RM_ATTC'); return loading('Attendance Correction'); }
            if (!d.ok) { return errCard('Attendance Correction', d.error); }

            var opts = '';
            for (var k in (d.sub_types || {})) {
                opts += '<option value="' + esc(k) + '">' + esc(d.sub_types[k]) + '</option>';
            }
            var yest = new Date(Date.now() - 86400000).toISOString().slice(0, 10);
            var form = '<div class="card" style="margin-bottom:14px"><div style="padding:16px 18px">'
                + '<div style="font-weight:700;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:12px">Raise a correction</div>'
                + '<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(170px,1fr));gap:14px">'
                + fieldRow('Date', '<input id="rmc-date" type="date" class="form-input" value="' + yest + '" onchange="rmcDay()" style="width:100%">')
                + fieldRow('What went wrong', '<select id="rmc-type" class="form-input" style="width:100%">' + opts + '</select>')
                + fieldRow('Correct check-in', '<input id="rmc-in" type="time" class="form-input" style="width:100%">')
                + fieldRow('Correct check-out', '<input id="rmc-out" type="time" class="form-input" style="width:100%">')
                + '</div>'
                + '<div id="rmc-orig" style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text3);margin:2px 0 12px"></div>'
                + fieldRow('Reason (required)', '<input id="rmc-reason" class="form-input" placeholder="e.g. Biometric did not capture my punch" style="width:100%">')
                + '<button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="rmcSubmit()"><i class="fas fa-paper-plane"></i> Submit request</button>'
                + '</div></div>';

            var cols = d.can_review
                ? ['Employee', 'Date', 'Type', 'Original', 'Requested', 'Approved', 'Status', '']
                : ['Date', 'Type', 'Original', 'Requested', 'Approved', 'Status', ''];
            var rows = '';
            for (var i = 0; i < (d.items || []).length; i++) {
                var r = d.items[i];
                var pair = function (a, b) {
                    if (!a && !b) { return '<span style="color:var(--text3)">—</span>'; }
                    return esc((a || '—') + ' / ' + (b || '—'));
                };
                var act = '';
                if (r.status === 'pending' && d.can_review) {
                    act = '<button class="btn btn-primary" style="padding:4px 10px;font-size:12px" onclick="rmcDecide(' + r.id + ",'approve'" + ')">Approve</button> '
                        + '<button class="btn btn-secondary" style="padding:4px 10px;font-size:12px" onclick="rmcDecide(' + r.id + ",'reject'" + ')">Reject</button>';
                } else if (r.status === 'pending') {
                    act = '<button class="btn btn-secondary" style="padding:4px 10px;font-size:12px" onclick="rmcCancel(' + r.id + ')">Cancel</button>';
                }
                rows += '<tr>'
                    + (d.can_review ? td(esc(r.emp_name || r.emp_code || '—')) : '')
                    + td(esc(r.date))
                    + td(esc(r.sub_type_label))
                    + td(pair(r.orig_in, r.orig_out))
                    + td(pair(r.req_in, r.req_out))
                    + td(pair(r.app_in, r.app_out))
                    + td(statusPill(r.status) + (r.payroll_locked ? ' ' + pill('payroll closed', '#fef3c7', '#92400e') : ''))
                    + td(act, 'text-align:right;white-space:nowrap')
                    + '</tr>';
            }
            var list = '<div class="card" style="padding:0">'
                + (rows ? (tblOpen(cols) + rows + tblClose) : empty('No correction requests yet.'))
                + '</div>';

            return pghead('Attendance Correction', d.can_review ? 'Review and approve regularisation requests' : 'Fix a wrong or missing attendance day', '')
                + form + list;
        }
        window.rmcDay = function () {
            var dt = val('rmc-date');
            if (!dt) { return; }
            fetch('/app/attendance-corrections/day?date=' + encodeURIComponent(dt),
                { headers: { 'X-Requested-With': 'XMLHttpRequest' }, credentials: 'same-origin' })
                .then(function (r) { return r.json(); })
                .then(function (j) {
                    var box = document.getElementById('rmc-orig');
                    if (!box) { return; }
                    if (j && j.ok && j.linked) {
                        box.innerHTML = j.has_attendance
                            ? 'Currently on record: <b>' + esc(j.orig_in || '—') + '</b> to <b>' + esc(j.orig_out || '—') + '</b>'
                            : 'Currently on record: <b>nothing</b> for this date.';
                    }
                })
                .catch(function () {});
        };
        window.rmcSubmit = function () {
            var body = {
                date: val('rmc-date'), sub_type: val('rmc-type'),
                req_in: val('rmc-in'), req_out: val('rmc-out'), reason: val('rmc-reason')
            };
            post('/app/attendance-corrections', body).then(function (j) {
                if (!j.ok) { say(j.error || 'Could not submit'); return; }
                say('Correction submitted for approval');
                window.__RM_ATTC = null; repaint();
            });
        };
        window.rmcCancel = function (id) {
            post('/app/attendance-corrections/' + id + '/cancel', {}).then(function (j) {
                if (!j.ok) { say(j.error || 'Could not cancel'); return; }
                say('Request cancelled'); window.__RM_ATTC = null; repaint();
            });
        };
        window.rmcDecide = function (id, action) {
            var body = { action: action };
            if (action === 'approve') {
                var t1 = prompt('Approved check-in (HH:MM) — leave blank to accept what was requested:', '');
                var t2 = prompt('Approved check-out (HH:MM) — leave blank to accept what was requested:', '');
                if (t1) { body.app_in = t1; }
                if (t2) { body.app_out = t2; }
                body.remarks = prompt('Remarks (optional):', '') || '';
            } else {
                var rr = prompt('Reason for rejection (required):', '');
                if (!rr) { say('Remarks are required to reject'); return; }
                body.remarks = rr;
            }
            post('/app/attendance-corrections/' + id + '/decide', body).then(function (j) {
                if (!j.ok) { say(j.error || 'Could not save'); return; }
                say(j.payroll_locked
                    ? 'Approved — payroll for that month is closed, so it will carry to the next adjustment'
                    : 'Approved and attendance updated');
                window.__RM_ATTC = null; repaint();
            });
        };

        // =================================================================
        // F6 / F7 — probation board + settings
        // =================================================================
        function probationScreen() {
            var d = window.__RM_PROB;
            if (!d) { getJson('/app/probation/board', '__RM_PROB'); return loading('Probation Tracking'); }
            if (!d.ok) { return errCard('Probation Tracking', d.error); }
            var head = pghead('Probation Tracking', 'Employees currently on probation',
                '<button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="go(&#39;probation-config&#39;)"><i class="fas fa-sliders"></i> Settings</button>');
            if (!d.items || !d.items.length) {
                return head + '<div class="card">' + empty('Nobody is on probation right now.') + '</div>';
            }
            var rows = '';
            for (var i = 0; i < d.items.length; i++) {
                var p = d.items[i];
                var due;
                if (p.overdue) { due = pill('overdue', '#fee2e2', '#b91c1c'); }
                else if (p.days_left === 0) { due = pill('today', '#fef3c7', '#92400e'); }
                else if (p.days_left <= 7) { due = pill(p.days_left + ' days', '#fef3c7', '#92400e'); }
                else { due = pill(p.days_left + ' days', '#dbeafe', '#1e40af'); }
                rows += '<tr>'
                    + td('<b>' + esc(p.name) + '</b>')
                    + td(esc(p.doj || '—'))
                    + td(esc(p.probation_end))
                    + td(due)
                    + td('<button class="btn btn-primary" style="padding:4px 10px;font-size:12px" onclick="rmpConfirm(' + p.employee_id + ')">Confirm</button> '
                        + '<button class="btn btn-secondary" style="padding:4px 10px;font-size:12px" onclick="rmpExtend(' + p.employee_id + ')">Extend</button>',
                        'text-align:right;white-space:nowrap')
                    + '</tr>';
            }
            return head + '<div class="card" style="padding:0">'
                + tblOpen(['Employee', 'Joined', 'Probation ends', 'Due in', '']) + rows + tblClose + '</div>';
        }
        window.rmpConfirm = function (empId) {
            if (!confirm('Confirm this employee as permanent? Statutory deductions (PF/PT/TDS) will resume from the next payroll run.')) { return; }
            post('/app/probation/' + empId + '/confirm', { remarks: prompt('Remarks (optional):', '') || '' }).then(function (j) {
                if (!j.ok) { say(j.error || 'Could not confirm'); return; }
                say('Employee confirmed as permanent'); window.__RM_PROB = null; repaint();
            });
        };
        window.rmpExtend = function (empId) {
            var nd = prompt('New probation end date (YYYY-MM-DD):', '');
            if (!nd) { return; }
            var rr = prompt('Reason for the extension (required):', '');
            if (!rr) { say('Remarks are mandatory when extending'); return; }
            post('/app/probation/' + empId + '/extend', { new_end: nd, remarks: rr }).then(function (j) {
                if (!j.ok) { say(j.error || 'Could not extend'); return; }
                say('Probation extended'); window.__RM_PROB = null; repaint();
            });
        };

        function probationConfigScreen() {
            var d = window.__RM_PROBCFG;
            if (!d) { getJson('/app/probation/config', '__RM_PROBCFG'); return loading('Probation Settings'); }
            if (!d.ok) { return errCard('Probation Settings', d.error); }
            var c = d.config || {};
            var rem = (c.reminder_days || []).join(', ');
            return pghead('Probation Settings', 'Default duration and reminder schedule', '')
                + '<div class="card"><div style="padding:18px 20px;max-width:560px">'
                + fieldRow('Default probation period (months)',
                    '<input id="rmpc-months" type="number" min="1" max="24" class="form-input" value="' + esc(c.default_months) + '" style="width:120px">')
                + fieldRow('Remind before (days, comma separated)',
                    '<input id="rmpc-days" class="form-input" value="' + esc(rem) + '" style="width:100%">')
                + '<label style="display:block;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:13.5px"><input id="rmpc-overdue" type="checkbox" ' + (c.overdue_nudge ? 'checked' : '') + '> Keep nudging once the date has passed</label>'
                + '<label style="display:block;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:13.5px"><input id="rmpc-hr" type="checkbox" ' + (c.notify_hr ? 'checked' : '') + '> Notify HR / admins</label>'
                + '<label style="display:block;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:13.5px"><input id="rmpc-mgr" type="checkbox" ' + (c.notify_manager ? 'checked' : '') + '> Notify the reporting manager</label>'
                + '<label style="display:block;margin-bottom:14px;font-size:13.5px"><input id="rmpc-emp" type="checkbox" ' + (c.notify_employee_on_confirm ? 'checked' : '') + '> Congratulate the employee on confirmation</label>'
                + '<button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="rmpcSave()"><i class="fas fa-floppy-disk"></i> Save settings</button>'
                + '</div></div>';
        }
        window.rmpcSave = function () {
            var days = [];
            var parts = val('rmpc-days').split(',');
            for (var i = 0; i < parts.length; i++) {
                var n = parseInt(parts[i], 10);
                if (!isNaN(n)) { days.push(n); }
            }
            post('/app/probation/config', {
                config: {
                    default_months: parseInt(val('rmpc-months'), 10) || 6,
                    reminder_days: days,
                    overdue_nudge: checked('rmpc-overdue'),
                    notify_hr: checked('rmpc-hr'),
                    notify_manager: checked('rmpc-mgr'),
                    notify_employee_on_confirm: checked('rmpc-emp')
                }
            }).then(function (j) {
                if (!j.ok) { say(j.error || 'Could not save'); return; }
                say('Probation settings saved'); window.__RM_PROBCFG = null; repaint();
            });
        };

        // =================================================================
        // F8 — greetings config, preview, test + log
        // =================================================================
        function greetingsScreen() {
            var d = window.__RM_GREET;
            if (!d) { getJson('/app/greetings/config', '__RM_GREET'); return loading('Greetings'); }
            if (!d.ok) { return errCard('Greetings', d.error); }
            var c = d.config || {};
            var b = c.birthday || {};
            var a = c.anniversary || {};
            var vars = (d.variables || []).join('  ');

            var block = function (key, t, obj, extra) {
                return '<div class="card" style="margin-bottom:14px"><div style="padding:16px 18px">'
                    + '<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px">'
                    + '<div style="font-weight:700;font-size:14px">' + esc(t) + '</div>'
                    + '<label style="font-size:13px;margin-left:auto"><input id="rmg-' + key + '-on" type="checkbox" ' + (obj.enabled ? 'checked' : '') + '> Enabled</label>'
                    + '</div>'
                    + (extra || '')
                    + fieldRow('Subject', '<input id="rmg-' + key + '-sub" class="form-input" value="' + esc(obj.subject) + '" style="width:100%">')
                    + fieldRow('Message', '<textarea id="rmg-' + key + '-msg" class="form-input" rows="5" style="width:100%">' + esc(obj.message) + '</textarea>')
                    + '<label style="font-size:13px;margin-right:14px"><input id="rmg-' + key + '-email" type="checkbox" ' + (obj.email ? 'checked' : '') + '> Send email</label>'
                    + '<label style="font-size:13px"><input id="rmg-' + key + '-inapp" type="checkbox" ' + (obj.in_app ? 'checked' : '') + '> Show in app</label>'
                    + '<div style="margin-top:12px">'
                    + '<button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="rmgPreview(&#39;' + key + '&#39;)"><i class="fas fa-eye"></i> Preview</button> '
                    + '<button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="rmgTest(&#39;' + key + '&#39;)"><i class="fas fa-paper-plane"></i> Send me a test</button>'
                    + '</div><div id="rmg-' + key + '-pv" style="margin-top:12px"></div>'
                    + '</div></div>';
            };

            return pghead('Greetings', 'Birthday and work-anniversary wishes',
                '<button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="go(&#39;greetings-log&#39;)"><i class="fas fa-envelope-open-text"></i> Delivery log</button>')
                + '<div class="card" style="margin-bottom:14px"><div style="padding:16px 18px">'
                + '<label style="font-size:14px;font-weight:600"><input id="rmg-on" type="checkbox" ' + (c.enabled ? 'checked' : '') + '> Send greetings automatically</label>'
                + '<div style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text3);margin:6px 0 12px">Greetings go out once a day at the hour you choose. Nothing is sent while this is off.</div>'
                + '<div style="display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:end">'
                + fieldRow('Send at (hour, 0-23)', '<input id="rmg-hour" type="number" min="0" max="23" class="form-input" value="' + esc(c.send_hour) + '" style="width:110px">')
                + '<label style="font-size:13px;padding-bottom:14px"><input id="rmg-hideyear" type="checkbox" ' + (c.hide_birth_year ? 'checked' : '') + '> Never show birth year</label>'
                + '<label style="font-size:13px;padding-bottom:14px"><input id="rmg-skipinactive" type="checkbox" ' + (c.skip_inactive ? 'checked' : '') + '> Skip inactive employees</label>'
                + '</div>'
                + '<div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text3);margin-top:6px">Available placeholders: <code>' + esc(vars) + '</code></div>'
                + '</div></div>'
                + block('bd', 'Birthday', b, '')
                + block('an', 'Work anniversary', a,
                    fieldRow('Only from year', '<input id="rmg-an-min" type="number" min="1" class="form-input" value="' + esc(a.min_years) + '" style="width:110px">'))
                + '<button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="rmgSave()"><i class="fas fa-floppy-disk"></i> Save greetings</button>';
        }
        function rmgCollect() {
            return {
                enabled: checked('rmg-on'),
                send_hour: parseInt(val('rmg-hour'), 10) || 9,
                hide_birth_year: checked('rmg-hideyear'),
                skip_inactive: checked('rmg-skipinactive'),
                birthday: {
                    enabled: checked('rmg-bd-on'), email: checked('rmg-bd-email'), in_app: checked('rmg-bd-inapp'),
                    subject: val('rmg-bd-sub'), message: val('rmg-bd-msg')
                },
                anniversary: {
                    enabled: checked('rmg-an-on'), email: checked('rmg-an-email'), in_app: checked('rmg-an-inapp'),
                    subject: val('rmg-an-sub'), message: val('rmg-an-msg'),
                    min_years: parseInt(val('rmg-an-min'), 10) || 1
                }
            };
        }
        window.rmgSave = function () {
            post('/app/greetings/config', { config: rmgCollect() }).then(function (j) {
                if (!j.ok) { say(j.error || 'Could not save'); return; }
                say('Greetings saved'); window.__RM_GREET = null; repaint();
            });
        };
        window.rmgPreview = function (key) {
            var type = key === 'bd' ? 'birthday' : 'anniversary';
            // Preview must NOT save — post the text as typed instead, so looking
            // at a preview can never switch greetings on by accident.
            post('/app/greetings/preview', {
                type: type, subject: val('rmg-' + key + '-sub'), message: val('rmg-' + key + '-msg')
            }).then(function (j) {
                var box = document.getElementById('rmg-' + key + '-pv');
                if (!box) { return; }
                if (!j.ok) { box.innerHTML = '<div style="color:var(--red)">' + esc(j.error) + '</div>'; return; }
                box.innerHTML = '<div style="border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:14px;background:var(--bg2,#f8fafc)">'
                    + '<div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text3);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.4px">Preview</div>'
                    + '<div style="font-weight:700;margin:6px 0">' + esc(j.subject) + '</div>'
                    + '<div style="font-size:13px;white-space:pre-wrap">' + esc(j.message) + '</div></div>';
            });
        };
        window.rmgTest = function (key) {
            var type = key === 'bd' ? 'birthday' : 'anniversary';
            // A test send must NOT save either.
            post('/app/greetings/test', {
                type: type, email: true,
                subject: val('rmg-' + key + '-sub'), message: val('rmg-' + key + '-msg')
            }).then(function (j) {
                say(j.ok ? ('Test sent to ' + (j.sent_to || 'you')) : (j.error || 'Could not send test'));
            });
        };

        function greetingsLogScreen() {
            var d = window.__RM_GLOG;
            if (!d) { getJson('/app/greetings/log', '__RM_GLOG'); return loading('Greetings Log'); }
            if (!d.ok) { return errCard('Greetings Log', d.error); }
            var head = pghead('Greetings Log', 'What has been sent',
                '<button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="go(&#39;greetings&#39;)"><i class="fas fa-sliders"></i> Settings</button>');
            if (!d.items || !d.items.length) { return head + '<div class="card">' + empty('Nothing sent yet.') + '</div>'; }
            var rows = '';
            for (var i = 0; i < d.items.length; i++) {
                var g = d.items[i];
                rows += '<tr>' + td(esc(g.at)) + td(esc(g.kind === 'greeting.birthday' ? 'Birthday' : 'Anniversary'))
                    + td(esc(g.title)) + td(statusPill(g.email_status || 'in-app')) + '</tr>';
            }
            return head + '<div class="card" style="padding:0">'
                + tblOpen(['When', 'Type', 'Message', 'Email']) + rows + tblClose + '</div>';
        }

        // =================================================================
        // F10 — previous-day absence settings
        // =================================================================
        function absenceConfigScreen() {
            var d = window.__RM_ABS;
            if (!d) { getJson('/app/absence/config', '__RM_ABS'); return loading('Absence Alerts'); }
            if (!d.ok) { return errCard('Absence Alerts', d.error); }
            var c = d.config || {};
            var days = (c.working_days || []).join(', ');
            return pghead('Absence Alerts', 'Tell people when yesterday has no attendance', '')
                + '<div class="card"><div style="padding:18px 20px;max-width:620px">'
                + '<label style="font-size:14px;font-weight:600"><input id="rma-on" type="checkbox" ' + (c.enabled ? 'checked' : '') + '> Send previous-day absence alerts</label>'
                + '<div style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text3);margin:6px 0 14px">Runs each morning for the previous day. People on approved leave, holidays and weekly offs are never flagged.</div>'
                + fieldRow('Send at (hour, 0-23)', '<input id="rma-hour" type="number" min="0" max="23" class="form-input" value="' + esc(c.send_hour) + '" style="width:110px">')
                + '<div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text3);margin:-6px 0 12px">Later is safer — it gives biometric imports time to arrive.</div>'
                + fieldRow('Working days (1=Mon … 7=Sun)', '<input id="rma-days" class="form-input" value="' + esc(days) + '" style="width:100%">')
                + '<label style="display:block;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:13.5px"><input id="rma-emp" type="checkbox" ' + (c.notify_employee ? 'checked' : '') + '> Notify the employee</label>'
                + '<label style="display:block;margin-bottom:14px;font-size:13.5px"><input id="rma-mgr" type="checkbox" ' + (c.notify_manager ? 'checked' : '') + '> Notify the reporting manager</label>'
                + '<button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="rmaSave()"><i class="fas fa-floppy-disk"></i> Save</button> '
                + '<button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="rmaRun()"><i class="fas fa-play"></i> Run now for yesterday</button>'
                + '<div id="rma-out" style="margin-top:12px;font-size:13px"></div>'
                + '</div></div>';
        }
        window.rmaSave = function () {
            var days = [];
            var parts = val('rma-days').split(',');
            for (var i = 0; i < parts.length; i++) {
                var n = parseInt(parts[i], 10);
                if (!isNaN(n) && n >= 1 && n <= 7) { days.push(n); }
            }
            post('/app/absence/config', {
                config: {
                    enabled: checked('rma-on'),
                    send_hour: parseInt(val('rma-hour'), 10) || 11,
                    working_days: days,
                    notify_employee: checked('rma-emp'),
                    notify_manager: checked('rma-mgr')
                }
            }).then(function (j) {
                if (!j.ok) { say(j.error || 'Could not save'); return; }
                say('Absence alert settings saved'); window.__RM_ABS = null; repaint();
            });
        };
        window.rmaRun = function () {
            var box = document.getElementById('rma-out');
            if (box) { box.textContent = 'Running…'; }
            post('/app/absence/run', {}).then(function (j) {
                if (!box) { return; }
                box.innerHTML = j.ok
                    ? 'Checked <b>' + j.evaluated + '</b> employees for ' + esc(j.date) + ' and notified <b>' + j.notified + '</b>.'
                    : '<span style="color:var(--red)">' + esc(j.error) + '</span>';
            });
        };

        // =================================================================
        // F9 — employee import wizard
        // =================================================================
        function empImportScreen() {
            var s = window.__RM_IMP || {};
            var h = window.__RM_IMPH;
            if (!h) { getJson('/app/employee-import/history', '__RM_IMPH'); }

            var step1 = '<div class="card" style="margin-bottom:14px"><div style="padding:16px 18px">'
                + '<div style="font-weight:700;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:4px">Step 1 — choose a file</div>'
                + '<div style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text3);margin-bottom:12px">CSV or Excel. The first row must be the column headings.</div>'
                + '<input id="rmi-file" type="file" accept=".csv,.txt,.xlsx,.xls" class="form-input" style="max-width:340px"> '
                + '<button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="rmiUpload()"><i class="fas fa-upload"></i> Read file</button>'
                + '</div></div>';

            var step2 = '';
            if (s.token && s.headers) {
                var opts = function (sel) {
                    var o = '<option value="">— ignore —</option>';
                    for (var i = 0; i < s.fields.length; i++) {
                        o += '<option value="' + esc(s.fields[i]) + '"' + (sel === s.fields[i] ? ' selected' : '') + '>' + esc(s.fields[i]) + '</option>';
                    }
                    return o;
                };
                var mrows = '';
                for (var i = 0; i < s.headers.length; i++) {
                    var hd = s.headers[i];
                    var sample = (s.sample && s.sample[0]) ? s.sample[0][hd] : '';
                    mrows += '<tr>' + td('<b>' + esc(hd) + '</b>')
                        + td('<span style="color:var(--text3)">' + esc(sample) + '</span>')
                        + td('<select class="form-input rmi-map" data-h="' + esc(hd) + '" style="width:100%">' + opts(s.mapping[hd]) + '</select>')
                        + '</tr>';
                }
                step2 = '<div class="card" style="margin-bottom:14px"><div style="padding:16px 18px">'
                    + '<div style="font-weight:700;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:4px">Step 2 — match the columns</div>'
                    + '<div style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text3);margin-bottom:12px">'
                    + esc(String(s.total)) + ' rows found. We have guessed the matches — change anything that looks wrong. <b>Name</b> is required.</div>'
                    + tblOpen(['Column in your file', 'First value', 'Import as']) + mrows + tblClose
                    + '<div style="margin-top:14px;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:end;flex-wrap:wrap">'
                    + fieldRow('If an employee already exists',
                        '<select id="rmi-dup" class="form-input" style="min-width:230px">'
                        + '<option value="update">Update their record</option>'
                        + '<option value="skip">Leave them unchanged</option>'
                        + '<option value="create">Add as a new employee</option></select>')
                    + '<div style="padding-bottom:12px"><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="rmiPreview()"><i class="fas fa-list-check"></i> Check the file</button></div>'
                    + '</div></div></div>';
            }

            var step3 = '';
            if (s.preview) {
                var p = s.preview;
                var cell = function (n, lbl, col) {
                    return '<div style="min-width:110px"><div style="font-size:26px;font-weight:800;color:' + col + '">' + n + '</div>'
                        + '<div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text3);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.4px">' + lbl + '</div></div>';
                };
                var errs = '';
                if (p.errors && p.errors.length) {
                    var er = '';
                    for (var e2 = 0; e2 < p.errors.length; e2++) {
                        er += '<tr>' + td('Row ' + p.errors[e2].row) + td(esc(p.errors[e2].message)) + '</tr>';
                    }
                    errs = '<div style="margin-top:14px"><div style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:6px;color:var(--red)">'
                        + 'Rows that will be skipped</div>' + tblOpen(['Row', 'Problem']) + er + tblClose + '</div>';
                }
                step3 = '<div class="card" style="margin-bottom:14px"><div style="padding:16px 18px">'
                    + '<div style="font-weight:700;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:12px">Step 3 — check, then import</div>'
                    + '<div style="display:flex;gap:26px;flex-wrap:wrap">'
                    + cell(p.create, 'will be added', '#15803d')
                    + cell(p.update, 'will be updated', '#1e40af')
                    + cell(p.skip, 'left unchanged', '#6b7280')
                    + cell(p.error_count, 'have problems', p.error_count ? '#b91c1c' : '#6b7280')
                    + '</div>' + errs
                    + '<div style="margin-top:16px"><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="rmiCommit()">'
                    + '<i class="fas fa-file-import"></i> Import ' + (p.create + p.update) + ' employees</button>'
                    + '<span style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text3);margin-left:12px">Nothing has been saved yet.</span></div>'
                    + '</div></div>';
            }

            var hist = '';
            if (h && h.ok && h.items && h.items.length) {
                var hr = '';
                for (var k = 0; k < h.items.length; k++) {
                    var j2 = h.items[k];
                    hr += '<tr>' + td(esc(j2.at)) + td(esc(j2.file || '—')) + td(statusPill(j2.status))
                        + td(String(j2.created)) + td(String(j2.updated)) + td(String(j2.skipped))
                        + td(j2.errors
                            ? '<a href="/app/employee-import/' + j2.id + '/errors.csv">' + j2.errors + ' — download</a>'
                            : '0')
                        + '</tr>';
                }
                hist = '<div class="card" style="padding:0"><div style="padding:14px 18px;font-weight:700;font-size:14px">Past imports</div>'
                    + tblOpen(['When', 'File', 'Status', 'Added', 'Updated', 'Skipped', 'Problems']) + hr + tblClose + '</div>';
            }

            return pghead('Import Employees', 'Upload a list, match the columns, check it, then import', '')
                + step1 + step2 + step3 + hist;
        }
        window.rmiUpload = function () {
            var el = document.getElementById('rmi-file');
            if (!el || !el.files || !el.files[0]) { say('Choose a file first'); return; }
            var fd = new FormData();
            fd.append('file', el.files[0]);
            say('Reading the file…');
            fetch('/app/employee-import/upload', {
                method: 'POST',
                headers: { 'X-CSRF-TOKEN': cfg.csrf, 'X-Requested-With': 'XMLHttpRequest' },
                credentials: 'same-origin', body: fd
            }).then(function (r) { return r.json(); }).then(function (j) {
                if (!j.ok) { say(j.error || 'Could not read that file'); return; }
                window.__RM_IMP = j;
                repaint();
            }).catch(function () { say('Upload failed'); });
        };
        function rmiMapping() {
            var m = {};
            var sels = document.querySelectorAll('.rmi-map');
            for (var i = 0; i < sels.length; i++) {
                m[sels[i].getAttribute('data-h')] = sels[i].value || null;
            }
            return m;
        }
        window.rmiPreview = function () {
            var s = window.__RM_IMP || {};
            s.mapping = rmiMapping();
            s.dup = val('rmi-dup') || 'update';
            post('/app/employee-import/preview', { token: s.token, mapping: s.mapping, dup_mode: s.dup })
                .then(function (j) {
                    if (!j.ok) { say(j.error || 'Could not check the file'); return; }
                    s.preview = j; window.__RM_IMP = s; repaint();
                });
        };
        window.rmiCommit = function () {
            var s = window.__RM_IMP || {};
            if (!confirm('Import now? This will add or update employee records.')) { return; }
            post('/app/employee-import/commit', { token: s.token, mapping: s.mapping, dup_mode: s.dup })
                .then(function (j) {
                    if (!j.ok) { say(j.error || 'Import failed'); return; }
                    say('Imported — ' + j.created + ' added, ' + j.updated + ' updated');
                    window.__RM_IMP = null; window.__RM_IMPH = null; repaint();
                });
        };

        // =================================================================
        // F1 — Statutory Configuration (effective-dated, scoped overrides)
        // =================================================================
        function scIntro() {
            return '<div class="card" style="margin-bottom:14px"><div style="padding:13px 16px;display:flex;gap:11px;align-items:flex-start">'
                + '<i class="fas fa-circle-info" style="color:var(--primary,#f97316);font-size:15px;margin-top:2px"></i>'
                + '<div style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text3);line-height:1.55">Set an override once and it applies from the date you choose, so regenerating an earlier month still uses that month rate. Narrowest scope wins: branch, then location, then company, then state, then the whole tenant. With nothing saved here, payroll uses exactly the rates it uses today.</div>'
                + '</div></div>';
        }
        function scLbl(label, ctl, hint) {
            return '<div style="flex:1;min-width:240px">'
                + '<label style="display:block;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;color:var(--text3);margin-bottom:6px">' + esc(label) + '</label>'
                + ctl + (hint ? ('<div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--text3);margin-top:5px">' + hint + '</div>') : '')
                + '</div>';
        }
        function scHistory(d) {
            var h = d.history || [];
            var head = '<div style="padding:13px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);font-weight:700;font-size:13.5px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px"><i class="fas fa-clock-rotate-left" style="color:var(--text3)"></i> History</div>';
            if (!h.length) {
                return '<div class="card" style="margin-top:16px">' + head + '<div style="padding:22px">' + empty('No statutory overrides saved yet.') + '</div></div>';
            }
            var rows = '';
            for (var i = 0; i < h.length; i++) {
                var r = h[i];
                var scopeTxt = r.scope === 'company' ? ('company #' + esc(r.company_id))
                    : (r.scope === 'tenant' ? 'whole tenant' : (esc(r.scope) + ' ' + esc(r.scope_value || '')));
                var vals = [];
                for (var k in (r.values || {})) {
                    var vv = r.values[k];
                    vals.push(esc(k) + '=' + esc((vv !== null && typeof vv === 'object') ? JSON.stringify(vv) : vv));
                }
                rows += '<tr>' + td(esc(r.effective_from || '-')) + td('<b>' + esc(r.kind_label || r.kind) + '</b>')
                    + td(scopeTxt) + td('<span style="color:var(--text3)">' + vals.join(', ') + '</span>') + td(esc(r.by || '')) + '</tr>';
            }
            return '<div class="card" style="margin-top:16px;padding:0">' + head
                + '<div style="overflow:auto">' + tblOpen(['Effective', 'Rates', 'Scope', 'Values', 'By']) + rows + tblClose + '</div></div>';
        }
        function ptSlabEditor(d) {
            var states = d.states || [];
            var o = '<option value="">Choose a state...</option>';
            for (var i = 0; i < states.length; i++) { o += '<option value="' + esc(states[i]) + '">' + esc(states[i]) + '</option>'; }
            var editor = '<div style="background:var(--bg2,#f8fafc);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:16px">'
                + '<div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;color:var(--text3);margin-bottom:10px">Edit a Professional Tax slab</div>'
                + '<div style="font-size:12.5px;color:var(--text3);margin-bottom:14px;line-height:1.55">Correct a state slab, add a state that is not built in, or mark a state Professional-Tax-free. Bands are entered as <b>upto:amount</b> pairs, comma separated, with <b>0</b> meaning everything above. Example: 7500:0, 10000:175, 0:200.</div>'
                + '<div style="display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:14px">'
                + scLbl('State', '<select id="sc-slab-state" class="form-input" style="width:100%">' + o + '</select>', '')
                + scLbl('Effective from', '<input type="date" id="sc-slab-eff" class="form-input" style="width:100%" value="' + esc(window.__STCFG_UI.eff) + '" onchange="scSet(&#39;eff&#39;,this.value)">', '')
                + '</div>'
                + '<label style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:14px;font-size:13px"><input type="checkbox" id="sc-slab-free" style="width:16px;height:16px"> This state has no Professional Tax</label>'
                + scLbl('Bands (upto:amount, comma separated; 0 = above all)', '<input type="text" id="sc-slab-bands" class="form-input" style="width:100%" placeholder="7500:0, 10000:175, 0:200">', '')
                + '<div style="display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;border-top:1px solid var(--border);margin-top:16px;padding-top:14px">'
                + '<button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="scSaveSlab()"><i class="fas fa-floppy-disk"></i> Save PT slab</button></div>'
                + '</div>';
            var slabs = d.slabs || [];
            var rows = '';
            for (var i = 0; i < slabs.length; i++) {
                var s = slabs[i];
                var bt = 'PT-free';
                if (!s.pt_free) {
                    var parts = [];
                    for (var j = 0; j < (s.bands || []).length; j++) {
                        var b = s.bands[j];
                        parts.push((b.upto > 0 ? ('upto ' + b.upto) : 'above') + ' = ' + b.amt);
                    }
                    bt = parts.join('; ');
                }
                var src = s.source === 'built-in' ? pill('built-in', '#e5e7eb', '#4b5563')
                    : (s.source === 'configured' ? pill('changed', '#dbeafe', '#1e40af') : pill('added', '#dcfce7', '#15803d'));
                rows += '<tr>' + td('<b>' + esc(s.state) + '</b>') + td('<span style="color:var(--text3)">' + bt + '</span>') + td(src) + '</tr>';
            }
            var ref = slabs.length ? ('<div class="card" style="margin-top:16px;padding:0"><div style="padding:13px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);font-weight:700;font-size:13.5px">Current PT slabs</div>'
                + '<div style="overflow:auto">' + tblOpen(['State', 'Bands', 'Source']) + rows + tblClose + '</div></div>') : '';
            return editor + ref;
        }
        function scScopeArgs() {
            var ui = window.__STCFG_UI;
            var a = { scope: ui.scope, scope_value: '', company_id: '' };
            if (ui.scope === 'company') { a.company_id = ui.company_id; }
            else if (ui.scope === 'state') { a.scope_value = ui.state; }
            else if (ui.scope === 'branch') { a.scope_value = ui.branch_id; }
            else if (ui.scope === 'location') { a.scope_value = ui.location; }
            return a;
        }
        function scCollect() {
            var d = window.__STCFG, ui = window.__STCFG_UI, kinds = d.kinds || [], ck = null;
            for (var i = 0; i < kinds.length; i++) { if (kinds[i].key === ui.kind) { ck = kinds[i]; } }
            var p = {}, fs = (ck && ck.fields) || [];
            for (var i = 0; i < fs.length; i++) {
                var f = fs[i];
                if (f.type === 'toggle') { p[f.key] = checked('scf-' + f.key); }
                else { var raw = val('scf-' + f.key); if (raw !== '') { p[f.key] = parseFloat(raw); } }
            }
            return p;
        }
        window.scSet = function (k, v) {
            var ui = window.__STCFG_UI; ui[k] = v;
            if (k === 'kind' || k === 'scope') { repaint(); }
        };
        window.scSave = function () {
            var ui = window.__STCFG_UI, a = scScopeArgs(), payload = scCollect(), hasVal = false;
            for (var k in payload) { hasVal = true; }
            if (!hasVal) { say('Enter at least one rate value'); return; }
            if (!ui.eff) { say('Choose an effective-from date'); return; }
            if (a.scope === 'company' && !a.company_id) { say('Choose a company'); return; }
            if ((a.scope === 'state' || a.scope === 'branch' || a.scope === 'location') && !a.scope_value) { say('Choose the ' + a.scope); return; }
            post('/app/statutory-config/save', {
                kind: ui.kind, scope: a.scope, scope_value: a.scope_value, company_id: a.company_id,
                effective_from: ui.eff, payload: payload, note: val('sc-note')
            }).then(function (j) {
                if (!j.ok) { say(j.error || 'Could not save'); return; }
                say(j.message || 'Saved'); window.__STCFG = null; repaint();
            });
        };
        window.scPreview = function () {
            var ui = window.__STCFG_UI, a = scScopeArgs(), payload = scCollect();
            var box = document.getElementById('sc-preview');
            if (box) { box.innerHTML = '<div style="color:var(--text3);font-size:13px"><i class="fas fa-spinner fa-spin"></i> Calculating impact...</div>'; }
            post('/app/statutory-config/preview', { company_id: a.company_id, payload: payload, month: ui.month }).then(function (j) {
                if (!box) { return; }
                if (!j.ok) { box.innerHTML = '<div style="color:var(--red);font-size:13px">' + esc(j.error || 'Could not preview') + '</div>'; return; }
                var rows = '', list = j.rows || [];
                for (var i = 0; i < list.length && i < 50; i++) {
                    var r = list[i];
                    var dc = r.delta > 0 ? '#15803d' : (r.delta < 0 ? '#b91c1c' : 'var(--text3)');
                    rows += '<tr>' + td(esc(r.name)) + td('<span style="color:var(--text3)">' + esc(r.state) + '</span>') + td(esc(r.net_before))
